# Rust build output — hundreds of MB, never commit.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock IS committed: this workspace ships binaries, and a locked
# dep set is what makes a user's `omarchy plugin add` build reproducible.
# (Library-only crates would exclude it; we are not one.)

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# dump_art output. It is a 2MB render artifact regenerated on every run,
# and it was committed by accident once (f6b89db) — it re-dirtied the
# tree on every feedback loop. Write renders wherever you like; they do
# not belong in the repo.
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
# The marketplace card. Generated by tools/make-preview.sh from the
# games' own renderers, and it has to be IN the repo: plugins.omarchy.org
# reads it from the checkout, and a plugin with no preview renders as a
# grey placeholder with its initials next to 105 other games.
!/preview.png
